    "traits": "Alteration",
    "description": "<p><strong>ALTERATION UTILITY</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tradition</strong> ethereal; <strong>Cast</strong> 1 AP (verbal); <strong>Duration</strong> end of your turn</p>\n<p>You move with unmatched agility and grace, granting you advantage on Reflex saving throws. Furthermore, you can move through difficult terrain without penalty and formidable terrain is treated as difficult.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> until the end of your turn your Reflex saves are rolled with advantage, difficult terrain costs you nothing extra and formidable terrain costs as difficult (interpretation 2: a zone's own Speed penalty still applies).</p>"
